# .NET build intermediates (the compiled DLL in Assemblies/ IS committed — it's what RimWorld loads)
**/obj/
**/bin/
*.user

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp

# RimWorld 1.7 writes a converted .dds next to every .png it loads, inside the mod folders (they're
# junctioned in, so it lands here). Generated cache, like obj/ -- never commit it.
# Exception: LocalPatches ships hand-made .dds replacement textures. Those are already tracked, so
# this rule doesn't touch them; a NEW intentional .dds must be added with `git add -f`.
*.dds
